{"game": "roboquest", "language": "english", "appid": 692890, "month": "2023-12", "window": 2, "start_date": 1701993600, "end_date": 1702684799, "month_true_total": 882, "quota": 14, "returned": 14, "pulled_at": "2026-10-03 01:52:58 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "153672618", "author": {"steamid": "76561198061815275", "personaname": "Criuh", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198061815275/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 24, "playtime_forever": 929, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 929, "last_played": 1702674481, "avatar": "ba3810d728c1900fa8c939b11bf60c52e55c595a"}, "language": "english", "review": "really good game, easy pick up and put back down or binge for hours!", "timestamp_created": 1702679784, "timestamp_updated": 1702679784, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "153665008", "author": {"steamid": "76561198114889065", "personaname": "BigBro2406", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198114889065/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 2419, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1858, "last_played": 1755035806, "avatar": "f5f3592b6871029a1e280ff7473ca09acf3fdcdb"}, "language": "english", "review": "", "timestamp_created": 1702671675, "timestamp_updated": 1702671675, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "153663026", "author": {"steamid": "76561198393364467", "personaname": "boomhauer", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/boomhauerr/", "num_games_owned": 202, "num_reviews": 106, "playtime_forever": 2426, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 191, "last_played": 1721254160, "avatar": "fce2b6eec640eb14f6f057c3e648c2e7ba907aa6"}, "language": "english", "review": "like gunfire reborn but...better? faster paced, everything is polished, and 70% of the guns dont feel useless. also doesnt have bad translations so every item description makes sense haha\n\nedit: getting stunned in this game is so counter productive its kinda sad; like in a game that rewards you for crackhead levels of movement, to then enact a mechanic that literally makes you FREEZE in place where you have to hit the same movement key three times, is lazy game design in my opinion. if there was some kind of middle ground i could understand, like if you could somehow still move maybe? idk just seems lazy and is a good way to ruin the immersion of the game.\n\nimagine playing doom, and then a QTE pops up that you have to do WITH MOVEMENT KEYS so you literally cant move while its happening and take damage even if you nail it perfectly. lazy! :) \n\notherwise beautiful and awesome game! wish it was able to do 3 people, but its okay that its only 2...i guess.", "timestamp_created": 1702669625, "timestamp_updated": 1704598950, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "153652423", "author": {"steamid": "76561198075707743", "personaname": "CoreyDaHuman", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198075707743/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 28, "playtime_forever": 700, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0