666", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "153621669", "author": {"steamid": "76561198011434104", "personaname": "SäC", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/sacapoon/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 33, "playtime_forever": 2167, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 52, "playtime_at_review": 752, "last_played": 1790027137, "avatar": "61d0b7751018dee6b0570c37070a59142662698e"}, "language": "english", "review": "Its dope", "timestamp_created": 1702619617, "timestamp_updated": 1702619617, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "153618526", "author": {"steamid": "76561199115574182", "personaname": "laugh factory 28281", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/sillydog2/", "num_games_owned": 78, "num_reviews": 13, "playtime_forever": 2561, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2558, "last_played": 1703815611, "avatar": "dfcb0a13f05babb81a193e8eee4330af255e42be"}, "language": "english", "review": "the game would be fun if it wasnt completely full of bugs and terrible design choices. memory loss while watching boss mini cutscenes forcing you to tab out over and over while your friend plays the game in slow motion, enemies spawning outside of the map completely forcing you to restart insane runs even right before the last boss haha!!! the damage scaling on half of the available weapons and characters makes no sense. why would you ever use an energy weapon when they will never even do close to half of what a non energy weapon can. Classes like the ranger have insane damage scaling potential while classes like the elementalist have terrible passives and perks that make you fall off completely by the end of a run.", "timestamp_created": 1702614518, "timestamp_updated": 1702614518, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.452447324991226196", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 19, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "153617297", "author": {"steamid": "76561197964752049", "personaname": "Bee", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/B2p3/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 6, "playtime_forever": 6546, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2226, "last_played": 1730532007, "avatar": "2907482421875778cc9978fa02ee07c18b2f125e"}, "language": "english", "review": "Great first person shooter co-op game. I generally do not like games such as nuclear throne or binding of isaac as I am a die-hard first person movement shooter player, but having a PVE rogue like game that is movement based has been a great time for myself and friends that are used to playing CSGO and TF2. I am greatly looking forward to any expansions/updates and I (and multiple friends) would gladly pay the full price of the game again for more content.", "timestamp_created": 1702612750, "timestamp_updated": 1702612750, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "153616747", "author": {"steamid": "76561198345836299", "personaname": "CheesyToastMan", "persona_status": "offline", "pr